1
00:00:00,928 --> 00:00:04,308
(Leonard:)...and then it'll end up in his closet
with all the other junk.

2
00:00:05,099 --> 00:00:06,519
(Penny:)Buy him the robot, Leonard.

3
00:00:08,685 --> 00:00:11,775
(Sheldon:)-Can I get this comic book too?
-Yes, you can.

4
00:00:16,318 --> 00:00:17,818
[PENNY SIGHS]

5
00:00:17,986 --> 00:00:19,116
(Stuart:)We meet again.

6
00:00:27,871 --> 00:00:31,211
(Leonard:)So, what did Justin say when you told him
he couldn't sleep on your couch?

7
00:00:31,375 --> 00:00:35,505
(Penny:)He's a musician.
He'll sleep in his own vomit if he has to.

8
00:00:44,096 --> 00:00:49,096
(Sheldon:)I should have asked for much more
than a comic book and a robot.

